## Code style
- No comments unless the WHY is non-obvious
- No placeholder code, no TODOs in output
- No unsolicited refactors — fix only what was asked
- Don't rewrite working code unless explicitly instructed
- Functional components only

## ESLint
9 deferred errors exist intentionally — do not fix them silently. Ask before touching.

## Output
Terse. No narration before or after changes. No summaries unless asked.
